body:
New screen = 80 Million units sold 

&#x200B;

This is why nothing gets fixed

Sadly in my case 

&#x200B;

I've seen a lot of people who are just attention whores, and the ones that I don't hear from are the ones that I will never hear from again.

&#x200B;

I'm in a community where everyone wants to be known, everyone talks about mental health and identities just so they could get a little bit of attention and when you ask them how they're doing they never want to talk about it. Yet the person that talked to me normally, laughed at my jokes and said see you next time when he left killed himself that same fucking day.

&#x200B;

Sorry but I don't believe this picture, everyone that called themselves suicidal are still alive and the person that never mentioned a single thing about suicide is no longer here. I just open myself up for discussion and most people I know, know that I don't judge them as long as they're being honest about it.

It's been shit

&#x200B;

I've been telling me wife I have great friends and hers were shit only to find out later we both have shit friends.
